ification of business activities to include mechanical and electrical business.","The company declared an interim single-tier tax-exempt dividend of 0.23 sen per share, with ex-date on 14 Oct 2026."],"risks_en":["The company established an ESOS of up to 10% of issued share capital, which may lead to potential dilution."],"earnings_en":""}